<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Heater Short Circuit Trip)/Pg 11 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

140 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Function: Protects against electrical failures, shutting down the system in the event of a short circuit in the heating elements.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

141 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Protection: Integrated circuit protection systems linked to the PLC for monitoring.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

142 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(SUBSYSTEM DETAILS)/E(SUBSYSTEM DETAILS)/Pg 11 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

143 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Expansion Valve, Dryers, Oil Separators, Pressure Transmitter, and Vibration Isolators:)/Pg 11 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

144 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(These key components will be sourced from reputable international manufacturers such as Danfoss, Emerson, Bitzer, Castel, Bummer, and Dryall ensuring reliability and top performance.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

145 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Evaporator and Heater Material:)/Pg 11 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

146 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The evaporator is designed with copper tubes and aluminum fins for efficient heat exchange and long-lasting durability.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

147 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Heating elements are constructed using stainless steel or Inconel sheathing offering excellent corrosion resistance. The system includes redundant over-temperature protection for added safety.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

148 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Refrigerant:)/Pg 11 0 R/K[20]>>
endobj

149 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The chamber\220s cooling system utilizes a water-cooled cascaded refrigeration system, employing R404A for the high stage and R23 for the low stage refrigerants.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[21]>>
endobj

150 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The system can be operated in auto mode or manual mode using the advanced PLC system, offering continuously variable power adjustments for precise control over the temperature environment.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

151 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(CONTROL SYSTEM)/E(CONTROL SYSTEM)/Pg 11 0 R/K[23]>>
endobj

152 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The chamber control system features:)/Pg 11 0 R/K[24]>>
endobj

153 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Dual PT100 A-Class temperature sensors for accurate and reliable temperature readings.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[25]>>
endobj

154 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Siemens PLC S7-1200 integrated with a 7" Weintek HMI, providing an intuitive user interface for easy control.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[26]>>
endobj

155 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Connectivity options include LAN and USB ports, along with an independent temperature controller to ensure precise temperature regulation.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[27]>>
endobj

156 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(An optional remote operation feature with the SESS Climatic Test Viewer PC software is available, allowing users to monitor and control the chamber from a remote location.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[28]>>
endobj

