<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(4)/Pg 11 0 R/K[29]>>
endobj

158 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 33 0 R/Pg 12 0 R>>
endobj

159 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(MATERIAL OF CONSTRUCTION)/E(MATERIAL OF CONSTRUCTION)/Pg 12 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

160 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Interior Material)/Pg 12 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

161 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The inner chamber will be constructed from AlSl grade SS304 stainless steel, known for its corrosion resistance and durability. The mirror-finish sheets have a thickness of 1.5 mm \(some parts may be 1.2 mm\), and all joints are TIG-welded for added strength and a smooth finish. The inner wall has minimal welded joints to ensure a clean, sleek surface.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

162 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Exterior Material)/Pg 12 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

163 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The outer wall of the chamber is made of CRCA steel \(Cold Rolled Close Annealed\) and is powder-coated for enhanced durability and aesthetic finish.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

164 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 33 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

165 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Insulation)/Pg 12 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

166 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The test space will be well-insulated to ensure thermal efficiency, and all necessary measures will be taken to prevent moisture condensation on the external surface of the chamber. The insulation is made of glass wool with a thickness of 150 mm, providing excellent thermal stability.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

167 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(SHELF FOR LOADING TEST ARTICLES)/E(SHELF FOR LOADING TEST ARTICLES)/Pg 12 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

168 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(A removable and height-adjustable stainless steel shelf with a load rating of 20 kg will be provided. The shelf allows flexible positioning for different test requirements.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

169 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Chamber Inner Viewing Lamp:)/Pg 12 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

170 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(A 20-watt lamp will be installed at the viewing window for easy monitoring of the chamber\220s interior. The lamp is operated via the HMI control for convenience.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

171 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Door Gasket:)/Pg 12 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

172 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The door will be sealed with a double-layer silicon gasket to ensure airtight sealing. The design includes one layer within the door and an additional outer layer for maximum insulation and temperature control.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

173 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Hinges & Latches:)/Pg 12 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

174 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The main door will be equipped with heavy-duty hinges, hinged on the left side, with secure locking mechanisms. The chamber will also feature removable side access panels \(not hinged\), allowing easy maintenance and access. Each panel will have a round insert panel lock for added security.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

175 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Mounting:)/Pg 12 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

176 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The chamber will be a vertical floor-mount type, equipped with four heavy-duty, lockable caster wheels capable of carrying 800 kg per wheel. This ensures easy mobility, while vibration isolation mechanisms will be provided to stabilize the chamber during operation. Provisions will be made to anchor the chamber, preventing movement during testing.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

177 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(5)/Pg 12 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

178 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 34 0 R/Pg 13 0 R>>
endobj

179 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(INDEPENDENT SAFETY TEMPERATURE CONTROLLER)/E(INDEPENDENT SAFETY TEMPERATURE CONTROLLER)/Pg 13 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

180 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(An independent controller will be included to limit the maximum temperature inside the chamber. If the set temperature exceeds the safe limit, the chamber will automatically shut down to ensure safety.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

181 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Power Supply:  Operates on AC 3-phase 415V \261 5%, 50Hz with neutral and ground \(N+G\), ensuring stable power input.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

