<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Sound Pressure Level:)/Pg 13 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

194 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 401 0 R/ActualText(Noise Level: Less than 80 dB \(A\) at a distance of 1 meter from the front door.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

