209 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(HMI Integration: A soft-touch-based control system has been implemented within the Human-Machine Interface \(HMI\), enabling full automation. This system allows for:)/Pg 14 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

210 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 405 0 R/ActualText(Seamless activation during profile creation via an event-based option)/Pg 14 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

211 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Fault Diagnosis Capabilities:)/Pg 14 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

212 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The control system includes advanced Fault Diagnosis features:)/Pg 14 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

213 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 406 0 R/ActualText(A diagnostic display for tracking parameters and input/output statuses)/Pg 14 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

214 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 407 0 R/ActualText(A Help menu for user assistance)/Pg 14 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

